    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/carpenter-shop/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Carpenter Shop serves as your digital workshop and carpentry portfolio, providing a specialized online space for carpenters, woodworkers, furniture makers, joinery experts, cabinetry specialists, and woodworking businesses to showcase their craftsmanship. It is ideal for promoting custom furniture design, wooden furniture crafting, modular kitchen work, cabinetry solutions, home renovation projects, wood restoration, interior woodwork, bespoke carpentry, and architectural woodworking services. With a clean, modern, and responsive layout, it ensures seamless viewing across desktops, tablets, and smartphones while maintaining fast performance and SEO-friendly structure for better search visibility. The theme includes dedicated sections for project galleries, service listings, pricing details, client testimonials, and contact forms to help attract and convert potential customers. Built with optimized and secure code, it supports WooCommerce for selling wooden products, furniture items, décor pieces, and custom woodwork orders, Contact Form 7 for customer inquiries and quote requests, and WPForms for lead generation and communication management. Customization options for colors, typography, and layouts allow full branding flexibility, making it suitable for carpentry studios, woodworking shops, furniture brands, and interior wood design services. Carpenter Shop provides a professional digital platform for showcasing craftsmanship, managing service inquiries, and growing a strong online presence in the woodworking and carpentry industry."
    },
